 gothi shows the 128x64 one-bit screen of the Flipper Zero with its original graphics and six keys: with the keyboard slid out the screen fills the display and the arrows, Enter and Backspace control it, with the keyboard closed there is a cross and a Back button for the touch screen. Applications: clock, battery, key test, a player of the firmware animations. Colour and screen size are set in Settings.
